    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="af21970f-6cfe-5fa3-bc71-819065cda58f" activityNameId="f2367902-a1ed-5815-8d57-6c4faee562f0" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Maintenance, operation, canal</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Maintenance, operation, canal
Assumption for the construction of the canal are derived from the Main-Donau-Canal in Germany. The canal is characterised by a width of 42 m and a average depth of 4m.  Life time of port is assumed to be 118 years. The canal bed area is estimated with 42m2. In addition, 10 meters at each edge is modelled as road traffic area.;
UUID: aff347f1-609b-30a4-9bd8-316ccf244491
This inventory includes the electricity consumption due to the operation of watergates. Land occupation and transformation are taken into account. 
Location: Data is based on  a case study of one canal in Germany.
Technology: unknown
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: literature studies and own assumptions 
Extrapolations: Data calculated for one canal in Germany is used as an estimate for Europe.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_aff347f1-609b-30a4-9bd8-316ccf244491.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="20a9bf48-6cea-59b4-ad08-000cb981f2d0" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
